### Sample REST Client for testing requests

### Get all notes
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/67f169d1e41298b1614dfcb5

### Post a new blog example 1
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/ HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "My First Blog",
    "author": "John Doe",
    "url": "https://example.com/blog1",
    "likes": 5
}

